sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Operator
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant E as Engine
    participant Z as ZDR Wiper
    U->>O: Submit task
    O->>E: Dispatch (policy checked)
    E-->>O: Result + telemetry
    O->>Z: Purge request
    Z-->>O: Residual 0.00 MB
    O-->>U: Signed receipt
